Independent relations: g5 is latent coupling gap; delta8 is product-state separation; g3 is projected gap; gJ is judgement gap.
R12 mapping: preserve penteract profile, fifth-coordinate meaning, eta_ind, W/H interaction order, phase, support, g5/delta8/g3/gJ, projection version, uncertainty, provenance, Delta_8S, relation class, and limitations.
Example: g5>tol5 and g3<=tol3 => PROJECTION_ONLY; delta8 and gJ remain independently recorded.
